CodeForge for VS Code — LICENSE (PENDING)
===========================================

STATUS: OWNER_AUTHORIZATION_REQUIRED — same unresolved fact as the repository root.

This extension is part of the CodeForge monorepo and carries the same MIT license type declared
in this package's own package.json ("license": "MIT"). The copyright HOLDER name for the MIT
grant is not yet confirmed at the repository level — see /LICENSE.pending at the repository root
for the full explanation and the canonical MIT text.

Do not treat this file, or this package.json's "license": "MIT" field, as authorization to
publish this extension to the VS Code Marketplace. Marketplace publication additionally requires:

  - a resolved copyright holder (this file becomes LICENSE once /LICENSE.pending does)
  - this package.json's "private": true to be deliberately removed
  - a README.md for this package (the Marketplace renders it as the listing page — currently
    absent; see docs/legal/remediation/r1-issue-disposition.md, LEG-P2-01)
  - marketplace icon/gallery metadata (currently absent)

`npm run audit:legal-release` fails closed on all of the above until they are resolved.
